# 基础词 Unit08
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2025红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 基础词Unit08核心词汇

{{fabric}}{{/ˈfæbrɪk}}{{n. 织物；结构}}{{The fabric of this dress is very soft.}}
{{facilitate}}{{/fəˈsɪlɪteɪt}}{{v. 促进；使便利}}{{Technology facilitates communication between people.}}
{{factor}}{{/ˈfæktər}}{{n. 因素；因子}}{{Several factors contributed to the success of the project.}}
{{fade}}{{/feɪd}}{{v. 褪色；消退}}{{The color of the curtain has faded over the years.}}
{{failure}}{{/ˈfeɪljər}}{{n. 失败；故障}}{{Failure is the mother of success.}}
{{fair}}{{/feər}}{{adj./n. 公平的；博览会}}{{The judge made a fair decision.}}
{{faith}}{{/feɪθ}}{{n. 信念；信仰；信任}}{{She has great faith in her children's abilities.}}
{{false}}{{/fɔːls}}{{adj. 错误的；假的}}{{The statement turned out to be false.}}
{{fame}}{{/feɪm}}{{n. 名声；声誉}}{{He achieved fame as a brilliant scientist.}}
{{familiar}}{{/fəˈmɪliər}}{{adj. 熟悉的；常见的}}{{The place looked very familiar to me.}}
{{fancy}}{{/ˈfænsi}}{{adj./v./n. 精致的；想象；爱好}}{{She has a fancy for collecting rare stamps.}}
{{fantastic}}{{/fænˈtæstɪk}}{{adj. 极好的；奇异的}}{{The view from the top of the mountain was fantastic.}}
{{fare}}{{/feər}}{{n. 票价；费用}}{{The bus fare has increased by 10%.}}
{{fascinate}}{{/ˈfæsɪneɪt}}{{v. 使着迷；吸引}}{{The documentary fascinated audiences worldwide.}}
{{fashion}}{{/ˈfæʃn}}{{n. 时尚；方式}}{{Paris is known as the fashion capital of the world.}}
{{fatal}}{{/ˈfeɪtl}}{{adj. 致命的；灾难性的}}{{The car accident was fatal to the driver.}}
{{fault}}{{/fɔːlt}}{{n. 错误；缺点；断层}}{{It is not my fault that the project failed.}}
{{favor}}{{/ˈfeɪvər}}{{n./v. 恩惠；支持；偏爱}}{{Could you do me a favor and pass me the salt?}}
{{feasible}}{{/ˈfiːzəbl}}{{adj. 可行的；可能的}}{{The plan is feasible within the given budget.}}
{{feature}}{{/ˈfiːtʃər}}{{n./v. 特征；以…为特色}}{{The phone has many new features.}}
{{federal}}{{/ˈfedərəl}}{{adj. 联邦的}}{{The federal government passed a new tax law.}}
{{fee}}{{/fiː}}{{n. 费用；酬金}}{{The tuition fee has increased this year.}}
{{feedback}}{{/ˈfiːdbæk}}{{n. 反馈；回馈}}{{We welcome feedback from our customers.}}
{{female}}{{/ˈfiːmeɪl}}{{adj./n. 女性的；雌性}}{{The company has more female employees than male.}}
{{fertile}}{{/ˈfɜːtaɪl}}{{adj. 肥沃的；多产的}}{{The land near the river is very fertile.}}
{{festival}}{{/ˈfestɪvl}}{{n. 节日；节庆}}{{The Spring Festival is the most important holiday in China.}}
{{fetch}}{{/fetʃ}}{{v. 取来；请来}}{{Can you fetch me a glass of water?}}
{{fiction}}{{/ˈfɪkʃn}}{{n. 小说；虚构}}{{She enjoys reading science fiction novels.}}
{{fierce}}{{/fɪəs}}{{adj. 猛烈的；凶猛的}}{{The competition for the job is fierce.}}
{{figure}}{{/ˈfɪɡər}}{{n./v. 数字；人物；计算；认为}}{{The figure shows a steady increase in population.}}
{{file}}{{/faɪl}}{{n./v. 文件；档案；提交}}{{Please save the file on your computer.}}
{{finance}}{{/ˈfaɪnæns}}{{n./v. 财政；资助}}{{The government needs to improve its finance management.}}
{{finding}}{{/ˈfaɪndɪŋ}}{{n. 发现；调查结果}}{{The findings of the research were published in a journal.}}
{{fine}}{{/faɪn}}{{adj./n./v. 好的；罚款；处以罚款}}{{He was fined for parking illegally.}}
{{firm}}{{/fɜːm}}{{adj./n. 坚定的；公司}}{{She works for a law firm in the city center.}}
{{fiscal}}{{/ˈfɪskl}}{{adj. 财政的；国库的}}{{The government introduced new fiscal policies.}}
{{fix}}{{/fɪks}}{{v. 修理；固定；确定}}{{The plumber came to fix the leaking pipe.}}
{{flag}}{{/flæɡ}}{{n. 旗帜；标志}}{{The national flag was raised during the ceremony.}}
{{flame}}{{/fleɪm}}{{n. 火焰；热情}}{{The candle flame flickered in the wind.}}
{{flash}}{{/flæʃ}}{{n./v. 闪光；闪现}}{{A flash of lightning lit up the sky.}}
{{flat}}{{/flæt}}{{adj./n. 平坦的；公寓}}{{The road is flat and easy to drive on.}}
{{flee}}{{/fliː}}{{v. 逃跑；逃避}}{{The refugees fled their homeland to escape the war.}}
{{flexible}}{{/ˈfleksəbl}}{{adj. 灵活的；可变通的}}{{The company offers flexible working hours.}}
{{float}}{{/fləʊt}}{{v. 漂浮；飘}}{{The leaves floated on the surface of the water.}}
{{flood}}{{/flʌd}}{{n./v. 洪水；淹没}}{{The heavy rain caused severe flooding in the area.}}
{{flourish}}{{/ˈflʌrɪʃ}}{{v. 繁荣；茂盛}}{{The business has flourished under new management.}}
{{flow}}{{/fləʊ}}{{v./n. 流动；流量}}{{The river flows through the center of the city.}}
{{fluent}}{{/ˈfluːənt}}{{adj. 流利的；流畅的}}{{She is fluent in three languages.}}
{{focus}}{{/ˈfəʊkəs}}{{v./n. 集中；焦点}}{{Please focus on the main points of the lecture.}}
{{fold}}{{/fəʊld}}{{v./n. 折叠；褶}}{{She folded the clothes neatly and put them away.}}
{{folk}}{{/fəʊk}}{{n./adj. 人们；民间的}}{{Folk music has a long tradition in this region.}}
{{follow}}{{/ˈfɒləʊ}}{{v. 跟随；遵循；理解}}{{Please follow the instructions carefully.}}
{{fond}}{{/fɒnd}}{{adj. 喜爱的；深情的}}{{She is very fond of classical music.}}
{{forbid}}{{/fəˈbɪd}}{{v. 禁止；不许}}{{Smoking is forbidden in public buildings.}}
{{forecast}}{{/ˈfɔːkɑːst}}{{v./n. 预测；预报}}{{The weather forecast predicts rain tomorrow.}}
{{foreign}}{{/ˈfɒrən}}{{adj. 外国的；外来的}}{{She is learning a foreign language.}}
{{forest}}{{/ˈfɒrɪst}}{{n. 森林}}{{The Amazon rainforest is the largest tropical forest in the world.}}
{{forever}}{{/fərˈevər}}{{adv. 永远；永恒地}}{{Nothing lasts forever.}}
{{forgive}}{{/fəˈɡɪv}}{{v. 原谅；宽恕}}{{She forgave him for his mistake.}}
{{formal}}{{/ˈfɔːml}}{{adj. 正式的；正规的}}{{The invitation requires formal attire.}}
{{format}}{{/ˈfɔːmæt}}{{n./v. 格式；格式化}}{{The report should be in PDF format.}}
{{former}}{{/ˈfɔːmər}}{{adj. 以前的；前者的}}{{The former president gave a speech at the event.}}
{{formula}}{{/ˈfɔːmjələ}}{{n. 公式；方案}}{{The mathematical formula is used to calculate the area.}}
{{fortune}}{{/ˈfɔːtʃuːn}}{{n. 命运；财富}}{{He made a fortune in the stock market.}}
{{forward}}{{/ˈfɔːwəd}}{{adv./adj. 向前；前进的}}{{She took a step forward to greet the guests.}}
{{fossil}}{{/ˈfɒsl}}{{n. 化石}}{{Scientists discovered a rare fossil in the desert.}}
{{found}}{{/faʊnd}}{{v. 建立；创建}}{{The company was founded in 1990.}}
{{foundation}}{{/faʊnˈdeɪʃn}}{{n. 基础；基金会}}{{Education is the foundation of a successful career.}}
{{fraction}}{{/ˈfrækʃn}}{{n. 分数；小部分；片段}}{{Only a fraction of the students passed the exam.}}
{{fragment}}{{/ˈfræɡmənt}}{{n. 碎片；片段}}{{Fragments of the broken vase were scattered on the floor.}}
{{framework}}{{/ˈfreɪmwɜːk}}{{n. 框架；结构}}{{The government established a new legal framework.}}
{{frank}}{{/fræŋk}}{{adj. 坦率的；真诚的}}{{To be frank, I don't think the plan will work.}}
{{fraud}}{{/frɔːd}}{{n. 欺诈；骗子}}{{He was convicted of financial fraud.}}
{{free}}{{/friː}}{{adj./v. 自由的；免费的；释放}}{{The prisoners were set free after the war.}}
{{freeze}}{{/friːz}}{{v. 冻结；冷冻}}{{Water freezes at zero degrees Celsius.}}
{{frequent}}{{/ˈfriːkwənt}}{{adj. 频繁的；经常的}}{{Frequent exercise helps maintain good health.}}
{{fresh}}{{/freʃ}}{{adj. 新鲜的；清新的}}{{The market sells fresh vegetables every morning.}}
{{friction}}{{/ˈfrɪkʃn}}{{n. 摩擦；冲突}}{{There is some friction between the two departments.}}
{{friendly}}{{/ˈfrendli}}{{adj. 友好的；亲切的}}{{The locals are very friendly to tourists.}}
{{frighten}}{{/ˈfraɪtn}}{{v. 使惊吓；使害怕}}{{The loud noise frightened the children.}}
{{frontier}}{{/ˈfrʌntɪər}}{{n. 边界；前沿；新领域}}{{Space is the final frontier for human exploration.}}
{{frustrate}}{{/frʌˈstreɪt}}{{v. 使沮丧；挫败}}{{The lack of progress frustrated the team.}}
{{fulfil/fulfill}}{{/fʊlˈfɪl}}{{v. 履行；实现；满足}}{{She fulfilled her dream of becoming a doctor.}}
{{function}}{{/ˈfʌŋkʃn}}{{n./v. 功能；运转}}{{The main function of the heart is to pump blood.}}
{{fund}}{{/fʌnd}}{{n./v. 基金；资助}}{{The university received a large fund for research.}}
{{fundamental}}{{/ˌfʌndəˈmentl}}{{adj. 基本的；根本的}}{{Freedom of speech is a fundamental human right.}}
{{funeral}}{{/ˈfjuːnərəl}}{{n. 葬礼；丧礼}}{{Hundreds of people attended the funeral.}}
{{furnish}}{{/ˈfɜːnɪʃ}}{{v. 提供；布置家具}}{{The apartment is fully furnished.}}
{{further}}{{/ˈfɜːðər}}{{adj./adv. 更远的；进一步地}}{{Further research is needed to confirm the findings.}}
{{fuss}}{{/fʌs}}{{n./v. 大惊小怪；忙乱}}{{Don't make a fuss over such a small matter.}}
{{future}}{{/ˈfjuːtʃər}}{{n./adj. 未来；将来的}}{{We should plan for the future carefully.}}
